sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Police as Police Field Officer
    actor Citizen as Citizen / Neighbor
    participant Portal as Police Station Portal
    participant PoliceAPI as Next.js API (/api/police/reports)
    participant CCTNS as CCTNS Crime Record Database
    participant FSM as FSM Engine (lib/fsm.ts)
    participant Prisma as Prisma Client (lib/prisma.ts)
    participant DB as Database

    Police->>Portal: View assigned station cases
    Portal->>PoliceAPI: GET /api/police/pending
    PoliceAPI->>Prisma: Fetch pending PVR dossiers
    Prisma->>DB: Query PoliceReport
    DB-->>Prisma: Case list
    Prisma-->>PoliceAPI: Return cases
    PoliceAPI-->>Portal: Render verification queue

    Police->>Portal: Assign self to case
    Portal->>PoliceAPI: PATCH /api/police/reports/{id} { status: IN_PROGRESS }
    PoliceAPI->>Prisma: Update status to IN_PROGRESS

    Police->>Citizen: Conduct physical address verification & witness interviews
    Citizen-->>Police: Provide statements and identity documents
    Police->>CCTNS: Check applicant against crime database
    CCTNS-->>Police: Criminal background check result

    alt Clean Verification
        Police->>Portal: Submit Clear PVR (CLEARED)
        Portal->>PoliceAPI: POST /api/police/reports/{id}/submit { status: CLEARED }
        activate PoliceAPI
        PoliceAPI->>FSM: Validate transition
        PoliceAPI->>Prisma: $transaction(update PoliceReport + Application to POLICE_VERIFICATION_COMPLETED)
        Prisma->>DB: Commit changes
        Prisma-->>PoliceAPI: Success
        PoliceAPI-->>Portal: 200 OK (Clear PVR submitted)
        deactivate PoliceAPI
        Portal-->>Police: Verification completed successfully
    else Adverse Verification
        Police->>Portal: Submit Adverse PVR (ADVERSE) with FIR details
        Portal->>PoliceAPI: POST /api/police/reports/{id}/submit { status: ADVERSE }
        activate PoliceAPI
        PoliceAPI->>Prisma: Update PoliceReport (ADVERSE) and Application
        Prisma->>DB: Commit changes
        PoliceAPI-->>Portal: 200 OK (Adverse PVR submitted)
        deactivate PoliceAPI
        Portal-->>Police: Adverse report forwarded to RPO
    end
